  "title": "Capital One to Acquire Brex",
  "summary": "MCLEAN, Va. & SAN FRANCISCO --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jan. 22, 2026-- Capital One Financial Corporation (NYSE: COF) today announced that it has entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Brex , in a combination of stock and cash transaction valued at $5.15 billion .",
